<style>
/* Layout: sticky tab bar (Map · Discussion · Compare · Remember · Past quiz · Quiz); Discussion is a sticky lesson index beside a 72ch reading column; tools sit in bordered "bench" panels. Palette: warm ledger paper with an ember accent; red-orange (hot) marks exothermic/energy out, blue (cold) marks endothermic/energy in, used only where the sign of energy flow is the point. */

:root{
