I("gibbs","What is the state function defined as G = H − TS, whose change predicts spontaneity at constant T and P, called?",["gibbs free energy","gibbs energy","free energy","gibbs","g"],"Gibbs free energy","<b>Gibbs free energy.</b> ΔG = ΔH − TΔS. It equals −TΔS<sub>universe</sub>, so ΔG &lt; 0 is the second law written in terms of the system alone, and it measures the maximum useful work available."),
